msgstr "نکتهs برای Successful عیب‌یابی"

#: ../../../Users/aakhtar/2-areas/miniconda-atomira-apps/atomate2-project/atomate2/docs/siesta/tutorials-md/05-troubleshooting/README.md:620
#: 2832b8e41b7a48aaa3762b86ddea8c6e
msgid ""
"✅ **Read error messages carefully**: They usually tell you exactly what's"
" wrong ✅ **Start simple**: Test with minimal system first (2-4 atoms) ✅ "
"**One change at a time**: Don't modify 5 parameters simultaneously ✅ "
"**Compare with working case**: If Si works but your system doesn't, "
"what's different? ✅ **Check literature**: Has anyone calculated this "
"material before? ✅ **Use custodian**: Let it fix common errors "
"automatically ✅ **Document what works**: Save working parameter sets for "
"similar systems ✅ **Don't over-tighten**: Tighter ≠ better (diminishing "
"returns after convergence)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/aakhtar/2-areas/miniconda-atomira-apps/atomate2-project/atomate2/docs/siesta/tutorials-md/05-troubleshooting/README.md:631
