#: f746c130b6ea4bf29076468412bc8140
msgid ""
"❌ **\"More k-points is always better\"**    → After convergence (~0.01 "
"eV), more k-points just waste time"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/aakhtar/2-areas/miniconda-atomira-apps/atomate2-project/atomate2/docs/siesta/tutorials-md/05-troubleshooting/README.md:636
#: 995e0e59200140f5adaba378756dd319
msgid ""
"❌ **\"SCF must converge to 1e-8\"**    → 1e-4 is usually sufficient; 1e-5"
" for forces; 1e-6 for phonons"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/aakhtar/2-areas/miniconda-atomira-apps/atomate2-project/atomate2/docs/siesta/tutorials-md/05-troubleshooting/README.md:639
